{"run_id": "20260830T102001-free-sql-116894", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies 7 analyses:\n\n- **2004.01678** — modified four-region ABCD estimate.\n- **2011.07812** — standard data-driven ABCD method using uncorrelated lepton-quality criteria.\n- **2012.01581** — ABCD-style ratio method with eight non-overlapping regions defined by three near-uncorrelated criteria.\n- **2207.00348** — double two-dimensional sideband method using three control regions.\n- **2404.06204** — two-dimensional ABCD sideband method with orthogonal control regions B, C, and D.\n- **2511.11853** — ABCD “matrix” method using data control regions and parametric fits.\n- **2604.27044** — multidimensional ABCD reweighting from control to signal regions.\n\nI excluded ordinary fake-lepton matrix methods that do not implement the requested ABCD-style construction over independent regions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2207.00348", "2404.06204", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ABCD background estimation method and ABCD-style independent-region sideband method", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:abcd-method | background_method | ABCD data-driven background estimation method\nhepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband | background_method | Two-dimensi"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "matrix method for background estimation using independent control regions", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\nhepkg:met"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.kind, e.entity_id, e.label FROM entity e WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix method%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%' ORDER BY e.kind, e.label LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 35, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | entity_id | label\nbackground_method | hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\nbackgroun"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, a.subject_id AS background_id, b.label AS background, a.object_id AS method_id, m.label AS method FROM assertion a JOIN entity m ON m.entity_id=a.object_id LEFT JOIN entity b ON b.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(m.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(m.label) LIKE '%two-dimensional sideband%' OR lower(m.label) LIKE '%2d sideband%' OR lower(m.label) LIKE '%modified abcd%' OR lower(m.label) LIKE '%multidimensional abcd%') ORDER BY a.paper_id, m.label LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | background_id | background | method_id | method\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision D"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, m.entity_id method_id, m.label method, ev.quote FROM assertion a JOIN entity m ON m.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id JOIN assertion_evidence ae ON ae.assertion_id=a.assertion_id JOIN evidence ev ON ev.evidence_id=ae.evidence_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%independent region%' OR lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%uncorrelated%' OR lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%matrix method%' OR lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%two-dimensional sideband%' OR lower(ev.quote) LIKE '%2d sideband%') ORDER BY a.paper_id, m.label LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | method_id | method | quote\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS De"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT ss.paper_id, p.title, sb.text FROM source_block sb JOIN source_snapshot ss ON ss.source_hash=sb.source_hash JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=ss.paper_id WHERE lower(sb.text) LIKE '%abcd%' ORDER BY ss.paper_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 23, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | text\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector | A “modified A"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT ss.paper_id, p.title, sb.text FROM source_block sb JOIN source_snapshot ss ON ss.source_hash=sb.source_hash JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=ss.paper_id WHERE (lower(sb.text) LIKE '%sideband method%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%sideband technique%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%matrix method%') AND (lower(sb.text) LIKE '%independent%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%uncorrelated%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%control region%') ORDER BY ss.paper_id LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | text\n2106.01676 | Search for chargino–neutralino pair production in final states with three leptons and missing transverse momentum\nin $\\sqrt{s}=13$ TeV $pp$ collisions with the ATL"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, m.entity_id, m.label FROM assertion a JOIN entity m ON m.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND m.entity_id IN ('hepkg:method:abcd-method','hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband','hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs','hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio','hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband','hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate','hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting') ORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | label\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the ATLAS Detector | "}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:continuum-gg-h-qqhqq", "hepkg:background:diboson_vv", "hepkg:background:dy_jets", "hepkg:background:fake-hf-leptons", "hepkg:background:heavy-flavor-mumu", "hepkg:background:multijet-z", "hepkg:background:qcd-multijet", "hepkg:background:single_top", "hepkg:background:sm_background_displaced_jets", "hepkg:background:sr-total", "hepkg:background:ttbar", "hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs", "hepkg:background_method:data_driven_nonprompt_control_sample", "hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband", "hepkg:method:abcd-method", "hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting", "hepkg:method:cr-data-driven-normalization", "hepkg:method:cr-mistag-rate-estimation", "hepkg:method:data-driven-background-fit", "hepkg:method:data-driven-fnp", "hepkg:method:data-driven-sideband-extrapolation", "hepkg:method:data-mixing-background-estimation", "hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio", "hepkg:method:data_driven_emu_cr", "hepkg:method:data_sideband_fit", "hepkg:method:dedicated_control_regions", "hepkg:method:discrete-profiling-method", "hepkg:method:discrete_profiling", "hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband", "hepkg:method:matrix-method", "hepkg:method:matrix_method", "hepkg:method:mc-simulation-default", "hepkg:method:mc-simulation-estimate", "hepkg:method:mc_simulation", "hepkg:method:mc_simulation_