{"run_id": "20260830T102001-free-sql-116894", "qid": "gabriel-gf-08", "repeat": 0, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses require exactly two electrons OR exactly two muons as alternative selections -- parallel ee and mumu channels, rather than requiring both?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "hard", "answer": {"text": "The analyses with an exclusive same-flavour dilepton choice—exactly two electrons (ee) **or** exactly two muons (μμ), treated as parallel channels—are:\n\n- **arXiv:2007.02873** — *Measurements of WH and ZH production in the H→bb decay channel…*\n- **arXiv:2404.06204** — *Precise measurements of W- and Z-boson transverse momentum spectra…*", "answered": true, "papers": ["2007.02873", "2404.06204"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "exactly two electrons ee channel selection", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object_selection:electron_2L | selection_requirement | 2L channel electron selection\nhepkg:object_selection:electron_1L | selection_requirement | 1L channel electron sel"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "exactly two muons mumu channel selection", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:object_selection:muon_2L | selection_requirement | 2L channel muon selection\nhepkg:object_selection:muon_1L | selection_requirement | 1L channel muon selection\nhepkg:fin"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, label, entity_id FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%exactly two%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%exactly 2%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%two electron%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%two muon%' LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 8, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | label | entity_id\nchannel | 2L2T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, >=2 h candidates) | hepkg:channel:2l2t\nchannel | 2L1T channel (exactly 2 light leptons, exactly 1 h candidate) | hepkg:channel"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id, eo.kind, eo.label FROM entity_occurrence eo WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:object_selection:electron_2L','hepkg:object_selection:muon_2L','hepkg:object:dilepton-system','hepkg:final_state:dimuon') ORDER BY eo.paper_id, eo.entity_id"}, "rows": 4, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | kind | label\n2009.04363 | hepkg:final_state:dimuon | channel | Two prompt, isolated, oppositely charged muons\n2009.14537 | hepkg:object:dilepton-system | detector_object | Dilep"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id,a.subject_id,a.predicate,a.object_id,e.label AS object_label,a.qualifiers FROM assertion a LEFT JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.object_id IN ('hepkg:object_selection:electron_2L','hepkg:object_selection:muon_2L','hepkg:object:dilepton-system','hepkg:final_state:dimuon') OR a.subject_id IN ('hepkg:object_selection:electron_2L','hepkg:object_selection:muon_2L','hepkg:object:dilepton-system','hepkg:final_state:dimuon') LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | subject_id | predicate | object_id | object_label | qualifiers\n2009.04363 | hepkg:result:116cfef0a2431c2e58b354ad | result_has_final_state | hepkg:final_state:dimuon | Two prompt, isolated,"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT p.arxiv_id,p.title FROM paper p WHERE p.latest_bundle_id IN (SELECT bundle_id FROM evidence WHERE lower(quote) LIKE '%exactly two electrons%' OR lower(quote) LIKE '%exactly two muons%' OR lower(quote) LIKE '%exactly two electron%' OR lower(quote) LIKE '%exactly two muon%')"}, "rows": 1, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "arxiv_id | title\n2009.04363 | Evidence for Higgs boson decay to a pair of muons\n(1 rows)"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.