{"run_id": "20260830T102001-free-sql-116894", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies 13 analyses matching the requested scope (including explicit/modified ABCD methods, multidimensional sidebands, and tight/loose matrix methods):\n\n- **2004.01678** — modified ABCD estimate\n- **2006.05880** — fake/non-prompt-lepton tight/loose matrix method\n- **2011.07812** — ABCD background estimate\n- **2012.01581** — ABCD-style ratio across eight non-overlapping regions\n- **2106.01676** — matrix method for fake/non-prompt leptons\n- **2202.08676** — matrix method for misidentified leptons\n- **2207.00348** — double two-dimensional sideband method\n- **2208.12095** — single-lepton fake/non-prompt matrix method\n- **2209.07327** — matrix method for nonprompt leptons\n- **2307.01094** — matrix method for fake/non-prompt leptons\n- **2404.06204** — two-dimensional ABCD sideband method\n- **2511.11853** — ABCD/matrix estimate using data control regions\n- **2604.27044** — multidimensional ABCD reweighting\n\nI excluded analyses that merely fit or validate against a single mass sideband, since those are not ABCD-style constructions over independent regions.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2006.05880", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2106.01676", "2202.08676", "2207.00348", "2208.12095", "2209.07327", "2307.01094", "2404.06204", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ABCD background estimation method using four independent regions", "kind": "background_method", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:abcd-method | background_method | ABCD data-driven background estimation method\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) d"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ABCD-style sideband matrix method independent regions for background estimation", "kind": "background_method", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:abcd-method | background_method | ABCD data-driven background estimation method\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) d"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT e.entity_id,e.kind,e.label,e.aliases FROM entity e WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix method%' LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 35, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label | aliases\nhepkg:region:abcd-region-a | event_region | Modified ABCD estimate: Region A | [\"Region A\"]\nhepkg:region:abcd-region-b | event_region | Modified ABCD estimate: Regio"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id,p.title,e.entity_id,e.label, s.label AS background_label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id LEFT JOIN entity s ON s.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND a.object_id IN ('hepkg:method:abcd-method','hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs','hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio','hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband','hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate','hepkg:method:double-2d-sideband','hepkg:method:matrix-method','hepkg:method:matrix_method','hepkg:method:abcd-reweighting') ORDER BY a.paper_id,e.entity_id"}, "rows": 17, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | label | background_label\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from th"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id,p.title,e.entity_id,e.label,s.label AS background_label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id LEFT JOIN entity s ON s.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%') ORDER BY a.paper_id,e.label"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | label | background_label\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from th"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id,p.title,e.entity_id,e.label,s.label AS background_label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id LEFT JOIN entity s ON s.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%matrix%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%sideband%') AND a.paper_id >= '2404' ORDER BY a.paper_id,e.label"}, "rows": 7, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | label | background_label\n2404.06204 | Precise measurements of $W$ - and $Z$ -boson transverse momentum\nspectra with the ATLAS detector using $pp$ collisions at $\\sqrt{s}"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 5, "args": {"text": "background estimate from independent or uncorrelated control regions factorization sideband matrix ABCD", "kind": "background_method", "limit": 40}, "rows": 40, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\nhepkg:bac"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT entity_id,lab