{"run_id": "20260830T102001-free-sql-116894", "qid": "gabriel-gf-04", "repeat": 1, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses unfold their measured distributions -- that is, correct them back to particle level or truth level?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The analyses in the graph that correct measured distributions for detector effects back to particle, parton, generator, or truth level are:\n\n- **2001.06899** — Z production with charm/bottom jets\n- **2110.11231** — inclusive and differential WZ production\n- **2206.09466** — Higgs production in the WW decay channel\n- **2207.12246** — elastic pp scattering and the ρ parameter\n- **2208.12095** — tt̄ charge asymmetry\n- **2303.15340** — inclusive and differential dilepton tt̄ production\n- **2308.02285** — W production with a charm quark\n- **2309.14442** — inclusive and differential tt̄bb production\n- **2312.04450** — inclusive and differential tt̄Z production\n- **2401.05299** — total and differential tt̄W production\n- **2402.08486** — differential tt̄ and additional-jet production\n- **2404.06204** — W- and Z-boson transverse-momentum spectra\n- **2408.03744** — inclusive W and Z cross sections at 5.02 and 13 TeV\n- **2506.13565** — high-mass dileptons with b-tagged jets; its lepton-flavor-ratio distributions are corrected for bin migration, acceptance, and efficiency", "answered": true, "papers": ["2001.06899", "2110.11231", "2206.09466", "2207.12246", "2208.12095", "2303.15340", "2308.02285", "2309.14442", "2312.04450", "2401.05299", "2402.08486", "2404.06204", "2408.03744", "2506.13565"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "unfold measured distribution to particle level truth level detector effects unfolding", "kind": "", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton | statistical_method | Unfolding of measurements to particle and parton levels\nhepkg:method:profile-likelihood-unfolding | statistical_m"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT kind, label, entity_id FROM entity WHERE lower(label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(label) LIKE '%truth level%' LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 51, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "kind | label | entity_id\nsystematic_uncertainty | PDF and mu_R, mu_F scale uncertainty (unfolding correction) | hepkg:systematic:pdf_scale_variation\nstatistical_method | Binned maximum likelihood fit "}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 1, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT paper_id, predicate, object_id, object_value FROM assertion WHERE lower(object_value) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(qualifiers) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(notes) LIKE '%unfold%' LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 100, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | predicate | object_id | object_value\n2001.06899 | result_defines_object | hepkg:object:particle_level_jet | \n2001.06899 | result_defines_object | hepkg:object:particle_level_lepton | \n2001."}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, e.entity_id, e.label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%bayesian%' OR lower(e.label) LIKE '%tunfold%') ORDER BY a.paper_id, e.label"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | label\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   Te"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, p.title, eo.entity_id, eo.label, eo.kind FROM entity_occurrence eo JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=eo.paper_id WHERE lower(eo.label) LIKE '%unfold%' ORDER BY eo.paper_id, eo.kind, eo.label"}, "rows": 38, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | entity_id | label | kind\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=1"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, a.predicate, e.entity_id, e.kind, e.label FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' ORDER BY a.paper_id, a.predicate, e.kind"}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | predicate | entity_id | kind | label\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE (a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method' AND lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%') OR (e.kind='result' AND lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%') ORDER BY a.paper_id"}, "rows": 12, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2110.11231 | Measu"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT ss.paper_id, p.title FROM source_block sb JOIN source_snapshot ss ON ss.source_hash=sb.source_hash JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=ss.paper_id WHERE lower(sb.text) LIKE '%unfolded%particle%level%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%unfold%truth%level%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%corrected%particle%level%' ORDER BY ss.paper_id"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2004.14060 | Searc"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT eo.paper_id, p.title FROM entity_occurrence eo JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=eo.paper_id WHERE eo.entity_id IN ('hepkg:method:unfolding-particle-parton','hepkg:method:profile-likelihood-unfolding','hepkg:method:fully_bayesian_unfolding','hepkg:method:tunfold_least_squares_unfolding','hepkg:method:tunfold-least-squares-unfolding','hepkg:method:iterative_unfolding','hepkg:statmethod:iterative-bayesian-unfolding','hepkg:statmethod:tunfold_regularized_unfolding','hepkg:method:binned_maximum_likelihood_fit') ORDER BY eo.paper_id"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2110.11231 | Measu"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, e.entity_id, e.label, ev.quote FROM assertion a JOIN entity e ON e.entity_id=a.object_id LEFT JOIN assertion_evidence ae ON ae.assertion_id=a.assertion_id LEFT JOIN evidence ev ON ev.evidence_id=ae.evidence_id WHERE a.paper_id IN ('2408.03744','2506.13565') AND (lower(e.label) LIKE '%unfold%' OR a.predicate='result_uses_statistical_method') ORDER BY a.paper_id, e.label LIMIT 50"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | entity_id | label | quote\n2408.03744 | hepkg:method:binned_maximum_likelihood_fit | Binned maximum likelihood fit for unfolding | The systematic uncertainties are treated as nuisance parame"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT ss.paper_id, sb.section_title, substr(sb.text,1,700) AS text FROM source_block sb JOIN source_snapshot ss ON ss.source_hash=sb.source_hash WHERE ss.paper_id IN ('2110.11231','2208.12095','2408.03744','2506.13565') AND lower(sb.text) LIKE '%unfold%' LIMIT 50"}, "rows": 50, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | section_title | text\n2110.11231 | Differential cross section measurements | Reconstructed and generated distributions for each of the considered observables are assumed to differ by the eff"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT ss.paper_id, p.title FROM source_block sb JOIN source_snapshot ss ON ss.source_hash=sb.source_hash JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=ss.paper_id WHERE (lower(sb.text) LIKE '%particle-level%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%particle level%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%truth-level%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%truth level%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%generator-level%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%generator level%') AND lower(sb.text) LIKE '%unfold%' ORDER BY ss.paper_id"}, "rows": 15, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title\n2001.06899 | Measurement of the associated production of a $\\mathup{{{Z}}}$ boson with charm or bottom quark jets in proton-proton collisions at $\\sqrt{s}=13$   TeV\n2110.11231 | Measu"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT sb.section_title, sb.text FROM source_block sb JOIN source_snapshot ss ON ss.source_hash=sb.source_hash WHERE ss.paper_id='2506.13565' AND lower(sb.text) LIKE '%tunfold%' LIMIT 10"}, "rows": 2, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "section_title | text\nReferences | [57]\n\nS. Schmitt, “TUnfold: an algorithm for correcting migration\neffects in high energy physics”, JINST 7 (2012)\nT10003,\ndoi: 10.1088/1748-0221/7/10/T10003 ,\narXiv:1"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT sb.section_title, sb.text FROM source_block sb JOIN source_snapshot ss ON ss.source_hash=sb.source_hash WHERE ss.paper_id='2408.03744' AND (lower(sb.text) LIKE '%unfold%' OR lower(sb.text) LIKE '%particle level%') LIMIT 20"}, "rows": 0, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "0 rows."}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:benchmark:resolved_kap