{"run_id": "20260830T102001-free-sql-116894", "qid": "gabriel-gf-02", "repeat": 2, "system": "free-sql", "config_hash": "4cc587a8ef30", "git_sha": "b0a569a-dirty", "question": "Which analyses estimate a background using an ABCD method, or an ABCD-style sideband or matrix method over independent regions?", "shape": "set", "split": "dev", "needs": ["sql"], "difficulty": "medium", "answer": {"text": "The graph identifies seven analyses:\n\n- **2004.01678** — modified ABCD estimate using four regions\n- **2011.07812** — ABCD background estimate\n- **2012.01581** — ABCD-style ratio using eight non-overlapping regions defined by near-uncorrelated selections\n- **2207.00348** — double two-dimensional sideband method\n- **2404.06204** — two-dimensional ABCD sideband method\n- **2511.11853** — ABCD/matrix technique using control regions\n- **2604.27044** — multidimensional ABCD reweighting technique\n\nI excluded ordinary fake-lepton “matrix methods” and generic mass-sideband fits where the graph did not characterize them as ABCD-style independent-region methods.", "answered": true, "papers": ["2004.01678", "2011.07812", "2012.01581", "2207.00348", "2404.06204", "2511.11853", "2604.27044"], "value": null, "steps": [{"tool": "search", "round": 1, "args": {"text": "ABCD background estimation method, including ABCD-style sideband or matrix method using independent regions", "kind": "", "limit": 20}, "rows": 20, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:method:abcd-method | background_method | ABCD data-driven background estimation method\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) d"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 2, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, a.subject_id AS background_id, eb.label AS background_label, a.object_id AS method_id, em.label AS method_label FROM assertion a LEFT JOIN entity eb ON eb.entity_id=a.subject_id LEFT JOIN entity em ON em.entity_id=a.object_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND a.object_id IN ('hepkg:method:abcd-method','hepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs','hepkg:background_method:z-multijet-abcd-sideband','hepkg:method:data_driven_abcd_ratio','hepkg:method:matrix-method') ORDER BY a.paper_id, method_label LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 13, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | background_id | background_label | method_id | method_label\n2011.07812 | hepkg:background:fake-hf-leptons | Fake and heavy-flavor-decay lepton background | hepkg:method:abcd-method | ABCD d"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 3, "args": {"text": "sideband background estimation with independent or uncorrelated regions", "kind": "", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:systematic:data_driven_bkg_method_uncertainty | systematic_uncertainty | Dedicated uncorrelated uncertainties from data-driven background estimation methods\nhepkg:method"}, {"tool": "search", "round": 3, "args": {"text": "matrix background method based on independent regions", "kind": "", "limit": 30}, "rows": 30, "error": null, "preview": "entity_id | kind | label\nhepkg:background_method:abcd_data_driven_crs | background_method | ABCD (matrix) data-driven background estimation using control regions in data with parametric fits\nhepkg:met"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 3, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, a.object_id AS method_id, em.label AS method_label, eb.label AS background_label FROM assertion a JOIN entity em ON em.entity_id=a.object_id LEFT JOIN entity eb ON eb.entity_id=a.subject_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(em.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(em.label) LIKE '%sideband%' OR lower(em.label) LIKE '%matrix%' OR lower(em.label) LIKE '%independent region%' OR lower(em.label) LIKE '%uncorrelated%region%') ORDER BY a.paper_id, em.label LIMIT 200"}, "rows": 25, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | method_id | method_label | background_label\n2004.01678 | hepkg:method:modified-abcd-estimate | Modified ABCD estimate | Total background estimate in the signal region\n2006.05880 | hepkg:met"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 4, "args": {"query": "SELECT DISTINCT a.paper_id, p.title, em.entity_id AS method_id, em.label AS method_label, ev.quote FROM assertion a JOIN entity em ON em.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id LEFT JOIN assertion_evidence ae ON ae.assertion_id=a.assertion_id LEFT JOIN evidence ev ON ev.evidence_id=ae.evidence_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND a.paper_id IN ('2004.01678','2011.07812','2012.01581','2207.00348','2404.06204','2511.11853','2604.27044') AND (lower(em.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(em.label) LIKE '%sideband%') ORDER BY a.paper_id LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 9, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | method_id | method_label | quote\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision Data from the AT"}, {"tool": "sql", "round": 5, "args": {"query": "SELECT a.paper_id, p.title, em.entity_id AS method_id, em.label AS method_label, a.support, a.qualifiers FROM assertion a JOIN entity em ON em.entity_id=a.object_id JOIN paper p ON p.arxiv_id=a.paper_id WHERE a.predicate='background_uses_method' AND (lower(em.label) LIKE '%abcd%' OR lower(em.label) LIKE '%two-dimensional sideband%' OR lower(em.label) LIKE '%2d-sideband%') ORDER BY a.paper_id, em.label LIMIT 100"}, "rows": 11, "error": null, "truncated": false, "preview": "paper_id | title | method_id | method_label | support | qualifiers\n2004.01678 | Search for Higgs Boson Decays into a $Z$ Boson and a Light Hadronically Decaying Resonance Using 13 TeV $pp$ Collision D"}], "sets": {}, "entity_ids": ["hepkg:background:combinatorial-background", "hepkg:background:diboson_vv", "hepkg:background:dy_jets", "hepkg:background:fake-hf-leptons", "hepkg:background:fake-nonprompt-leptons", "hepkg:background:fnp-lepton-rjr", "hepkg:background:heavy-